# Signing keys — never commit the private key.
# CI signs releases using the TAURI_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY repository secret.
# The .pub file is safe to track; it must match the pubkey in tauri.conf.json.
src-tauri/updater.key
!src-tauri/updater.key.pub

